35.1 Compare-and-swap

Every canonical mutation occurs in one transaction:
read
→ compare expected revision
→ pure mutation
→ recalculate
→ integrity validate
→ increment revision
→ calculate project hash
→ commit

A stale tab cannot overwrite a newer revision.
BroadcastChannel may notify other tabs but cannot become another store.

35.2 Integrity

On load, hash the canonical project excluding its stored hash.
A mismatch quarantines the project.
Corruption cannot be normalized into apparent validity.
A quarantined project is read-only. Its only permitted actions are integrity diagnostics, exact raw export, verified backup restore, clone-from-auditable-source where permitted, and controlled deletion. It cannot be silently recalculated, normalized, migrated into current state, or reopened as valid canonical state.

